{"seq":3,"slug":"rl-cai-stage","title":"RL 阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/rlaif/rl-cai-stage","wordCount":1590,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"rl-阶段\">RL 阶段</h1><p>有了一个能给任意回答打分的偏好模型，最后一步就是用强化学习把策略推向高分区域。这一步叫 RL-CAI，它和标准 RLHF 的 PPO 阶段几乎一模一样——同样的策略梯度、同样的 KL 正则、同样的价值函数——唯一的差别是奖励来自 <a href=\"preference-model\">偏好模型</a>，而那个偏好模型是用 AI 反馈训的，不是人标的。本篇讲这个强化学习循环怎么跑、KL 正则为什么不可或缺、以及它最终把模型带到了哪个位置。整条流水线的起点在 <a href=\"../supervised/sl-cai-stage\">监督学习阶段</a>，此处是它的终点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RL-CAI 用强化学习把策略推向偏好模型的高分区——框架与标准 RLHF 的 PPO 阶段几乎一模一样，只是奖励来自 AI 反馈训的偏好模型。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>策略初始化</strong>：不是随便一个模型，而是 SL-CAI 模型——这是「先监督再强化」的落点，RL 只需在好起点附近精调。</li>\n<li><strong>有效奖励</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{total}}(x,y) = r_\\phi(x,y) - \\beta \\, \\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_\\theta \\| \\pi_{\\text{ref}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；奖励不等于偏好分本身，而是减去 KL 惩罚项。</li>\n<li><strong>KL 正则</strong>：把当前策略拴在初始 SL-CAI 策略附近，防止它奔向偏好模型盲区刷分（奖励攻击）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 过大则学不动、过小则挣脱缰绳。</li>\n<li><strong>链式思维打分</strong>：反馈模型评估时先展开推理再下结论，让偏好判断质量接近人类标签——是 RLAIF 能与 RLHF 打平的重要原因。</li>\n<li><strong>结果</strong>：「有用—无害」帕累托前沿整体外移——更无害、几乎不损有用、更少回避。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：与 RLHF 只差奖励来源，却因此把整条对齐流水线走通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ppo-循环-从-sl-cai-出发\">PPO 循环：从 SL-CAI 出发</h2><p>RL-CAI 的策略初始化不是随便一个模型，而是 <a href=\"../supervised/sl-cai-stage\">监督学习阶段</a> 训出的 SL-CAI 模型——这正是先监督再强化的意义：起点已经无害且不太回避，RL 只需精调。循环里，策略对提示采样回答，偏好模型给回答打分作奖励，PPO 据此更新策略，如此反复。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[SL-CAI 模型&lt;br/&gt;作为初始策略] --&gt; B[对提示采样回答]&#10;    B --&gt; C[偏好模型打分 r]&#10;    B --&gt; D[计算与初始策略的 KL 散度]&#10;    C --&gt; E[综合奖励 = r - beta·KL]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[PPO 更新策略]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    F --&gt; G[RL-CAI 最终模型]\">flowchart TD\n    A[SL-CAI 模型&lt;br/&gt;作为初始策略] --&gt; B[对提示采样回答]\n    B --&gt; C[偏好模型打分 r]\n    B --&gt; D[计算与初始策略的 KL 散度]\n    C --&gt; E[综合奖励 = r - beta·KL]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[PPO 更新策略]\n    F --&gt; B\n    F --&gt; G[RL-CAI 最终模型]</pre><p>图里最该注意的是奖励不等于偏好分本身，而是偏好分减去一个 KL 惩罚项。下一节解释为什么这个减法是整个 RL 阶段的安全带。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kl-正则-拴住策略别跑偏\">KL 正则：拴住策略别跑偏</h2><p>偏好模型只是个代理（见 <a href=\"preference-model\">偏好模型</a> 末尾的隐患），PPO 又是个不知疲倦的优化器——如果只让它最大化偏好分，策略会一路狂奔到偏好模型的盲区，产出人看着荒谬但分数虚高的回答，这就是奖励攻击。防止它的标准手段，是在奖励里加一个 KL 散度惩罚，把当前策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拴在初始 SL-CAI 策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近。有效奖励写作</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{total}}(x,y) = r_\\phi(x,y) \\;-\\; \\beta \\, \\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x)\\,\\|\\,\\pi_{\\text{ref}}(\\cdot\\mid x)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 控制这条缰绳的松紧：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 太大，策略几乎不动、学不到东西；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 太小，策略挣脱缰绳去刷分、发生奖励攻击。这个权衡是所有 RLHF/RLAIF 训练的通用难题，其一般形式见 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/reward-modeling/rlhf-ppo\">RLHF 与 PPO</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 取值</th>\n<th>策略行为</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过大</td>\n<td>几乎不偏离 SL-CAI</td>\n<td>学不动，无害性提升有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>稳步向高分移动</td>\n<td>平衡点，理想区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过小</td>\n<td>激进追逐偏好分</td>\n<td>奖励攻击、输出退化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"链式思维在-rl-阶段的角色\">链式思维在 RL 阶段的角色</h2><p>RL-CAI 一个容易被忽视的细节是：反馈模型在打分时用了链式思维（chain-of-thought）。也就是说，偏好模型评估两个回答哪个更无害时，会先展开一段推理再下结论，而不是直接给概率。论文报告，带思维链的 AI 反馈让偏好判断的质量接近人类标签训出的偏好模型，这是 RLAIF 能与 RLHF 打平的重要原因之一。</p>\n<p>不过思维链在这里是「训练时的评估辅助」，最终部署的策略并不一定把这段推理暴露给用户。这层「用推理提升评估质量、但推理本身可能不外显」的取舍，也埋下了一个更大的隐忧——如果模型的内部推理越来越不体现在输出里，可扩展监督就更难做，这正是 <a href=\"../practice/scalable-oversight\">可扩展监督</a> 要展开的话题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rl-cai-训完之后-帕累托的移动\">RL-CAI 训完之后：帕累托的移动</h2><p>RL-CAI 的最终产物，是一个在「有用—无害」平面上整体更靠外的模型。Bai 等人（arXiv:2212.08073）报告的核心结果是：RL-CAI 模型相比纯 RLHF 模型，在几乎不损失有用性的前提下显著更无害，而且更少回避——它会解释为什么拒绝，而不是冷冰冰挡回去。用前几篇反复出现的联合目标看，就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha h + (1-\\alpha)u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 这条帕累托前沿被整体往外推了一截。</p>\n<p>要强调这是训练时对齐的成果，它把价值观烤进权重，不等于运行时就万无一失。训完的模型仍要过红队检验、并常在推理时叠加额外防线，这些是 <a href=\"../practice/red-teaming-cai\">红队与稳健性</a> 的内容。至此，从立原则到自我修订、从 AI 反馈到强化学习的完整链路走通了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RL-CAI 用 PPO 把策略推向偏好模型的高分区，框架与标准 RLHF 相同，只是奖励来自 AI 反馈训的偏好模型。</li>\n<li>策略从 SL-CAI 模型初始化——这是「先监督再强化」的落点，RL 只需在好起点附近精调。</li>\n<li>奖励是偏好分减 KL 惩罚：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r-\\beta\\,\\mathrm{KL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span>，KL 项把策略拴在初始模型附近防奖励攻击，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 松紧要调。</li>\n<li>反馈打分用链式思维提升评估质量，是 RLAIF 逼近 RLHF 的关键；但推理不外显埋下监督隐忧。</li>\n<li>结果是「有用—无害」帕累托前沿整体外移：更无害、几乎不损有用、更少回避。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>提供奖励的偏好模型怎么训：<a href=\"preference-model\">偏好模型</a></li>\n<li>RL 的起点从哪来：<a href=\"../supervised/sl-cai-stage\">监督学习阶段</a></li>\n<li>训完的模型如何被检验：<a href=\"../practice/red-teaming-cai\">红队与稳健性</a></li>\n<li>推理不外显引出的监督难题：<a href=\"../practice/scalable-oversight\">可扩展监督</a></li>\n<li>PPO 与 KL 正则的通用机制：<a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/reward-modeling/rlhf-ppo\">RLHF 与 PPO</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：Bai et al., <em>Constitutional AI: Harmlessness from AI Feedback</em>, arXiv:2212.08073，§4 RL-CAI；Schulman et al., <em>Proximal Policy Optimization</em>, arXiv:1707.06347。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RL 阶段","id":"rl-阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PPO 循环：从 SL-CAI 出发","id":"ppo-循环-从-sl-cai-出发"},{"level":2,"text":"KL 正则：拴住策略别跑偏","id":"kl-正则-拴住策略别跑偏"},{"level":2,"text":"链式思维在 RL 阶段的角色","id":"链式思维在-rl-阶段的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"RL-CAI 训完之后：帕累托的移动","id":"rl-cai-训完之后-帕累托的移动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"偏好模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/rlaif/preference-model"},"next":{"title":"红队与稳健性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/practice/red-teaming-cai"}}